# Commit messages (Source Control ✨ Generate)

When Cursor auto-generates a Git commit message for this repository (the sparkle button in Source Control), you MUST write it in Simplified Chinese.

Format: <type>(optional scope): <short Chinese summary>

- type: feat, fix, docs, refactor, test, chore, build, ci, style, or perf
- Subject only, under 72 characters
- Add a short Chinese body only when it materially improves clarity
- Base the message only on staged changes; do not exaggerate scope
- Documentation-only changes use docs
- Never include secrets, tokens, keys, or account information
- Do not write the subject in English

Examples:
- feat(upload): 支持拖拽与粘贴输入图片
- fix(raster): 修正 JPEG 导出缺少白底
- chore: 完善 gitignore 并停止跟踪 docs
